From: seilent <github@seilent.net>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: wcd938x: treat a failed zdet ramp as floating impedance

A ramp error left zdet at 0, so a failed measurement read as 0 ohm on
both channels and the plug was classified as mono.

---
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd938x.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd938x.c
@@ -2097,6 +2097,7 @@
 	if (!c1 || !x1) {
 		dev_err(component->dev, "Impedance detect ramp error, c1=%d, x1=0x%x\n",
 			c1, x1);
+		*zdet = WCD938X_ZDET_FLOATING_IMPEDANCE;
 		goto ramp_down;
 	}
 	d1 = d1_a[c1];
